//       lb/ton.
//   lentil 39.4 / 6.43 / 8.12: dry seed. N: FDC 172420 lentils, raw: 24.63 / 6.25. P2O5:
//       FDC 281 mg P. K2O: FDC 677 mg K (no table row).
//   fava_bean 41.8 / 9.64 / 12.7: dry seed. N: FDC 175205 broadbeans (fava), mature seeds,
//       raw: 26.12 / 6.25. P2O5: FDC 421 mg P. K2O: FDC 1062 mg K.
//   mung_bean 38.2 / 8.4 / 15: dry seed. N: FDC 174256 mung beans, mature seeds, raw: 23.86
//       / 6.25. P2O5: FDC 367 mg P. K2O: FDC 1246 mg K.
//   pigeon_pea 34.7 / 8.4 / 16.7: dry seed. N: FDC 172436 pigeon peas, mature seeds, raw:
//       21.7 / 6.25. P2O5: FDC 367 mg P. K2O: FDC 1392 mg K.
//   peanut 36 / 3.89 / 6: nuts in shell. N: NRCS peanuts 3.60%. P2O5: NRCS 0.17% P (A2809
//       has no peanut). K2O: NRCS 0.50% K.
//   sunflower 35.7 / 12 / 13.3: seed (crop_nutrition.ron: seed). N: NRCS sunflower 3.57%.
//       P2O5: A2809 sunflower 0.012 lb/lb. K2O: NRCS 1.11% K, not A2809 0.024 lb/lb (2.0%
